This repository contains the bridge implementation and documentation of
observed protocol behavior. Protocol research included inspection of INZONE
Hub and live device reports. Sony binaries, decompiled Sony source, firmware,
and local capture logs are not distributed here.

The bridge has no third-party NuGet package dependencies. Release packages
are framework-dependent: the Microsoft .NET runtime is installed separately
and is subject to its own license. The MIT license applies to this project's
code and documentation, not to Sony software, trademarks, or the .NET runtime.
